+  ['A speed of 72 km/h equals:', ['18 m/s', '20 m/s', '22 m/s', '25 m/s'], 1, 'Speed and Distance', 'Multiply km/h by 5/18: 72 × 5/18 = 20 m/s.'],
+  ['A 180-metre train moving at 54 km/h crosses a pole in:', ['10 seconds', '12 seconds', '15 seconds', '18 seconds'], 1, 'Speed and Distance', '54 km/h = 15 m/s; 180 ÷ 15 = 12 seconds.'],
